{"version":3,"term":{"cols":112,"rows":50},"timestamp":1795540855,"command":"/var/mnt/DiscoAgentic/Proyectos/10-rust/hodei-security-platform/hodei-artifacts-wt-hsp265/scripts/community-quickstart.sh run '--distribution' '/tmp/hodei-demo.xoy5is/dist'","title":"hodei-artifacts community quickstart","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/bash"}}
[0.012, "o", "\r\n==> The lab\r\n"]
[0.021, "o", "    lab:        /tmp/hodei-community-lab.ZfI0Yp\r\n    home:       /tmp/hodei-community-lab.ZfI0Yp/home\r\n    distribution: /tmp/hodei-demo.xoy5is/dist\r\n    binary:     /tmp/hodei-demo.xoy5is/dist/bin/hodei-artifacts-api\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "==> The service\r\n"]
[0.962, "o", "    it answers on http://127.0.0.1:43604 (pid 2906472)\r\n\r\n==> The temporary token\r\n"]
[0.025, "o", "    principal: hrn:hodei:iam::lab:User/pioneer\r\n    the secret is ephemeral and lives in /tmp/hodei-community-lab.ZfI0Yp/secret\r\n\r\n==> The account and its repositories\r\n"]
[0.015, "o", "    created lab-raw (raw, hosted) -> 201\r\n"]
[0.014, "o", "    created lab-maven (maven2, hosted) -> 201\r\n\r\n==> The first publish: a Raw blob\r\n"]
[0.027, "o", "    published lab-raw/quickstart/hello.txt -> 201\r\n    digest: sha256:77146402cf60b8656969fabb44fc7b5467c5b6bba25b8f69e489a007324122a8\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n==> The first publish: a Maven package\r\n"]
[0.041, "o", "    published lab-maven/com/acme/lib/1.0.0/lib-1.0.0.jar -> 201\r\n"]
[0.015, "o", "    published the sha1 of the jar -> 200\r\n"]
[0.025, "o", "    published lab-maven/com/acme/lib/1.0.0/lib-1.0.0.pom -> 201\r\n"]
[0.016, "o", "    published the sha1 of the pom -> 200\r\n\r\n==> The first pull\r\n"]
[0.021, "o", "    the Raw blob came back with the same digest: 77146402cf60b8656969fabb44fc7b5467c5b6bba25b8f69e489a007324122a8\r\n"]
[0.024, "o", "    the Maven jar came back with the same content\r\n"]
[0.017, "o", "    the checksum of the jar came back: cdda0528c8b79460f8e6f87d1dffbfb9ac35bc61\r\n\r\n==> The restart\r\n"]
[1.164, "o", "    the service is up again on the same port and the same data\r\n"]
[0.020, "o", "    the catalog kept both repositories\r\n"]
[0.020, "o", "    the Raw blob kept its digest: 77146402cf60b8656969fabb44fc7b5467c5b6bba25b8f69e489a007324122a8\r\n"]
[0.023, "o", "    the Maven package kept its content\r\n"]
[0.015, "o", "    the same token is still the credential, and without it the answer is 401\r\n"]
[0.204, "o", "\r\n==> The summary\r\n    raw blob:    sha256:77146402cf60b8656969fabb44fc7b5467c5b6bba25b8f69e489a007324122a8\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "    maven jar:   sha256:887b47d7e8a496f4619f48ed13cf800025efb58515da80e1fc54eace53e73bad\r\n    maven sha1:  cdda0528c8b79460f8e6f87d1dffbfb9ac35bc61\r\n    lab:         /tmp/hodei-community-lab.ZfI0Yp\r\n\r\n    the service is stopped. To keep it running:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "      community-quickstart.sh serve --lab-dir /tmp/hodei-community-lab.ZfI0Yp\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    to remove everything the lab created:\r\n      community-quickstart.sh cleanup --lab-dir /tmp/hodei-community-lab.ZfI0Yp\r\n"]
[0.001, "x", "0"]
